div.min-w-0
  .flex.flex-nowrap.items-center.gap-x-5.min-w-0
    .flex.min-w-0.flex-1.items-center.gap-2
      .flex.items-center.gap-1.shrink-0
        = f.label :visibility, "公開範囲", class: "text-sm font-medium kb-text-primary whitespace-nowrap"
        details.relative
          summary class=kb_hint_trigger
            i[data-lucide="circle-help" class="h-4 w-4"]
          div class="absolute left-0 top-6 z-20 w-80 #{kb_hint_popover}"
            | 「グループ」系は共有グループの指定が必要です。一覧・編集は権限のあるメモのみ表示されます。
      = f.select :visibility, memo_visibility_options_for_select, {}, class: memo_form_underline_input("font-sans min-w-0 flex-1")
    .flex.min-w-0.flex-1.items-center.gap-2
      = f.label :memo_group_id, "共有グループ", class: "text-sm font-medium kb-text-primary whitespace-nowrap shrink-0"
      = f.select :memo_group_id, @memo_groups_for_form.map { |g| [g.name, g.id] }, { include_blank: "（なし）" }, class: memo_form_underline_input("font-sans min-w-0 flex-1")
  - if memo.errors[:visibility].any?
    p.mt-1.text-sm.text-red-700 = memo.errors[:visibility].first
  - if memo.errors[:memo_group_id].any?
    p.mt-1.text-sm.text-red-700 = memo.errors[:memo_group_id].first
